' The two-way radio at the keyboard (`preset extended ai amiga seed 12 give
' item_two_way_radio`, v12_radio's world). With the radio every place that is
' no city and not his can be selected (`SelectLocationInDirection` takes
' what `CanShowInfo` allows): Right reaches One Man's Heaven and then
' Outback, which no road from Hard Mans Death leads to; F gives Outback's
' radio report, as v12_radio's click does. Without the radio the same keys
' select only cities and the places a road leads to.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
day
wait 30
press right              ' One Man's Heaven
press right              ' Outback
wait 2
press f                  ' the radio's report
wait 10
talkline 2               ' Okay
wait 5
quit
